  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks like a big ladybug about the size of an adult’s fist. Its semi-circular milky white carapace is decorated with dark spots.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the aperture it is a white-shell, black spotted ladybug.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is rank three Sky Canopy Gu at the moment the fusion finishes.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It remains a rank three defensive Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          205
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_defensive_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its appearance is a large ladybug about the size of an adult’s fist, with a semi-circular milky white carapace marked by dark spots.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it dances as a white-shell, black-spotted ladybug above the primeval sea.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When activated with primeval essence, it covers the body in white light armor.",
        "chapters": [
          162
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ordinary centipede bites do nothing against that white crystal armor.",
        "chapters": [
          162
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It has great defense but cannot reduce the force from impacts.",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan judges that canopy Gu might have impressive defense but is too rigid,",
        "chapters": [
          288
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "and thinks the Gu is not good at defending against close combat attacks.",
        "chapters": [
          281
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Frenzy needle bee Gu at rank three can pierce it; chapter 209 says that piercing swarm counters Sky Canopy Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          207
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_frenzy_needle_bee_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A rank one initial stage’s green bronze primeval essence can barely run it. Even with high aptitude and Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus support, a few minutes of use can dry the aperture out, and the armor looks weak without rank three aura.",
        "chapters": [
          200
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan places Sky Canopy Gu in his kit under the six classifications as the defense slot, paired with Blood Moon Gu for attack. That is a kit role, not a named cultivation path for this Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "role-among-the-six-classifications",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_moon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Mao Mountain and early wandering chapters describe the armor effect without assigning a path name.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "role-among-the-six-classifications",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
